  "review_description": "Both terminal artifacts are retained: the HMMER3 profile and domain-search table. Eighteen final controls behaved as expected; native oracle/no-op rewards were 1/0 and the blind GLM solver scored 1. The existing single quality repair corrected a probe expectation, with fresh controls and source-aware review afterward. The known unused packaged answer fixture was removed and the native build enforces the same exclusion. No operator edited the scientific task. The independent solution uses the same HMMER engine; different-engine portability, biological validity and broad factory reliability are unproven. The upstream standard quality-loop label remains unverified.",
